WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.963
Inventory counting in Quark WMS. Follow a stock count on
an RF terminal.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.316
The operator identifies the work area and location, then
records what is physically present.

3
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.633
Select the count work area before continuing to the
warehouse location.

4
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.459
Identify the location to count on the RF terminal.

5
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.018
The count screen shows the location and asks for stock
details.

6
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.081
Identify the stock and enter the quantity physically
counted.

7
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.137
Continue recording the stock found at this location.

8
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.436
Use the SKU, lot and pallet fields where applicable to the
stock being counted.

9
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.154
Finish the location count once the observations have been
entered.

10
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:28.770
The final message flags a difference for supervisor
review.
